// 表7 PushSampleResult：檢驗結果主動通知(SampleResult)之資料模型
// 本檔由欄位對應定義產生；元素名稱即原 JSON 欄位名稱(保留大小寫)。
Logical: SampleResultModel
Id: SampleResultModel
Title: "檢驗結果主動通知(SampleResult)之資料模型"
Description: "NIDRS 表7 疾管署主動回饋個案檢驗結果至通報單位(Web Service PushSampleResult，參數 SampleResult，含 SampleAntibodyResult 與 SamplePathogenResult)之資料模型。原規格為 C# 類別定義，未列基數；本模型將識別欄位設為 1..1、其他參考型別(string、List)為選填，實值型別(int、bool、DateTime)不可為 null 故設為 1..1。"
* ^version = "0.1.0"
* ^status = #draft
* ReportId 1..1 string "通報單編號" "通報單編號。原規格資料型態：string。"
* ReportId ^example.label = "範例"
* ReportId ^example.valueString = "1140300012345"
* SampleId 1..1 string "送驗單編號" "送驗單編號。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SampleId ^example.label = "範例"
* SampleId ^example.valueString = "AB-123-456789"
* DiseaseId 0..1 string "送驗疾病代碼" "送驗疾病代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* DiseaseId from CDCTestDisease (required)
* DiseaseId ^example.label = "範例"
* DiseaseId ^example.valueString = "061"
* DiseaseName 0..1 string "送驗疾病中文名稱" "送驗疾病中文名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* DiseaseName ^example.label = "範例"
* DiseaseName ^example.valueString = "登革熱"
* ResultInformDay 1..1 dateTime "檢驗結果時間" "檢驗結果時間。原規格資料型態：DateTime。"
* ResultInformDay ^example.label = "範例"
* ResultInformDay ^example.valueDateTime = "2025-08-10T16:00:00+08:00"
* ResultId 0..1 string "檢驗結果代碼" "檢驗結果代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* ResultName 0..1 string "檢驗結果名稱" "檢驗結果名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SampleAntibodyResults 0..* BackboneElement "血清學檢驗結果" "血清學檢驗結果清單(List<SampleAntibodyResult>)。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.SeqNo 1..1 integer "血清學檢驗序號" "血清學檢驗序號。原規格資料型態：int。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.SeqNo ^example.label = "範例"
* SampleAntibodyResults.SeqNo ^example.valueInteger = 1
* SampleAntibodyResults.AntibodyId 0..1 string "血清學檢驗方法代碼" "血清學檢驗方法代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.AntibodyName 0..1 string "血清學檢驗方法名稱" "血清學檢驗方法名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.AntibodyResultId 0..1 string "血清學檢驗結果代碼" "血清學檢驗結果代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.AntibodyResultName 0..1 string "血清學檢驗結果名稱" "血清學檢驗結果名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.Titer 0..1 string "效價" "效價(Titer)。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.Titer ^example.label = "範例"
* SampleAntibodyResults.Titer ^example.valueString = "1:320"
* SampleAntibodyResults.FourFoldRise 1..1 boolean "是否四倍上升" "是否四倍上升。原規格資料型態：bool。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.FourFoldRise ^example.label = "範例"
* SampleAntibodyResults.FourFoldRise ^example.valueBoolean = false
* SampleAntibodyResults.Comments 0..1 string "血清學檢驗結果備註" "血清學檢驗結果備註。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.ResultDay 1..1 dateTime "血清學檢驗日期" "血清學檢驗日期。原規格資料型態：DateTime。"
* SampleAntibodyResults.ResultDay ^example.label = "範例"
* SampleAntibodyResults.ResultDay ^example.valueDateTime = "2025-08-09T09:00:00+08:00"
* SamplePathogenResults 0..* BackboneElement "病原體檢驗結果" "病原體檢驗結果清單(List<SamplePathogenResult>)。"
* SamplePathogenResults.SeqNo 1..1 integer "病原體檢驗序號" "病原體檢驗序號。原規格資料型態：int。"
* SamplePathogenResults.SeqNo ^example.label = "範例"
* SamplePathogenResults.SeqNo ^example.valueInteger = 1
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenId 0..1 string "病原體檢驗方法代碼" "病原體檢驗方法代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenId from CDCPathogenMethod (extensible)
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenName 0..1 string "病原體檢驗方法名稱" "病原體檢驗方法名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenResultId 0..1 string "病原體檢驗結果代碼" "病原體檢驗結果代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenResultName 0..1 string "病原體檢驗結果名稱" "病原體檢驗結果名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.MasterId 0..1 string "病原體大類代碼" "病原體大類代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.MasterId from CDCPathogen (required)
* SamplePathogenResults.MasterName 0..1 string "病原體大類名稱" "病原體大類名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.DetailId 0..1 string "病原體細類代碼" "病原體細類代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.DetailId from CDCPathogen (required)
* SamplePathogenResults.DetailName 0..1 string "病原體細類名稱" "病原體細類名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.SubTypeId 0..1 string "病原體次分型代碼" "病原體次分型代碼。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.SubTypeName 0..1 string "病原體次分型名稱" "病原體次分型名稱。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.Comments 0..1 string "病原體檢驗結果備註" "病原體檢驗結果備註。原規格資料型態：string。"
* SamplePathogenResults.ResultDay 1..1 dateTime "病原體檢驗日期" "病原體檢驗日期。原規格資料型態：DateTime。"
* SamplePathogenResults.ResultDay ^example.label = "範例"
* SamplePathogenResults.ResultDay ^example.valueDateTime = "2025-08-09T09:00:00+08:00"

Mapping: SampleResultModelToFHIR
Id: nidrs-to-fhir
Title: "NIDRS JSON → FHIR"
Description: "PushSampleResult JSON 欄位與本 IG FHIR R4 Profile 元素之對應；格式為「Profile Id: FHIR 元素路徑」，註解為轉換說明。"
Source: SampleResultModel
Target: "http://hl7.org/fhir/R4"
* -> "Bundle-nidrs-push-sample-result: Bundle；MessageHeader-nidrs-push-sample-result: MessageHeader；DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport" "原為 Web Service PushSampleResult(string jsonString)，回傳 Boolean；FHIR 以訊息 Bundle 傳送，MessageHeader.eventCoding = CDCMessageEvent#PushSampleResult；SampleResult 不含個案證號，DiagnosticReport.subject(必填)由疾管署依通報單號帶入個案證號並以 identifier 參照"
* ReportId -> "DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.extension[report].valueReference.identifier.value" "workflow-reasonReference 擴充以 identifier(system = nidrs-report-id)參照通報單"
* SampleId -> "DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.identifier[barcode].value；DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.basedOn.identifier.value" "system = https://lims.cdc.gov.tw/；basedOn 以同一送驗單編號參照 ServiceRequest"
* DiseaseId -> "DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.code.coding[testDisease].code" "system = CodeSystem cdc-test-disease"
* DiseaseName -> "DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.code.coding[testDisease].display" "亦可填入 code.text"
* ResultInformDay -> "DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.issued" "C# DateTime 序列化值(如 2025-01-02T10:20:30，無時區)轉為 FHIR 時補上 +08:00(instant 須含秒與時區)"
* ResultId -> "DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.conclusionCode.coding.code" "system = TWIDIR CodeSystem twcdc-testresult-values"
* ResultName -> "DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.conclusionCode.coding.display" "亦可填入 conclusionCode.text"
* SampleAntibodyResults -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation；DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.result" "每一筆建立一筆 Observation-nidrs-antibody-result，subject 與 DiagnosticReport 相同"
* SampleAntibodyResults.SeqNo -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.identifier.value" "整數轉為字串；建議與送驗單編號組合以確保唯一"
* SampleAntibodyResults.AntibodyId -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.code.coding.code" "system = https://ancientsky.github.io/fhir_ig_demo/CodeSystem/cdc-antibody-method(content = not-present)"
* SampleAntibodyResults.AntibodyName -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.code.coding.display" "亦可填入 code.text"
* SampleAntibodyResults.AntibodyResultId -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.interpretation.coding.code" "system = TWIDIR CodeSystem twcdc-testresult-values"
* SampleAntibodyResults.AntibodyResultName -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.interpretation.coding.display" "直接對應"
* SampleAntibodyResults.Titer -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.component[titer].valueString" "component.code = CDCNIDRSObservation#TITER"
* SampleAntibodyResults.FourFoldRise -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.component[fourFoldRise].valueBoolean" "component.code = CDCNIDRSObservation#FOUR_FOLD_RISE"
* SampleAntibodyResults.Comments -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.note.text" "直接對應"
* SampleAntibodyResults.ResultDay -> "Observation-nidrs-antibody-result: Observation.effectiveDateTime" "C# DateTime 序列化值(如 2025-01-02T10:20:30，無時區)轉為 FHIR 時補上 +08:00"
* SamplePathogenResults -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation；DiagnosticReport-nidrs-sample-result: DiagnosticReport.result" "每一筆建立一筆 Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result，subject 與 DiagnosticReport 相同"
* SamplePathogenResults.SeqNo -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.identifier.value" "整數轉為字串；建議與送驗單編號組合以確保唯一"
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenId -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.code.coding.code" "system = CodeSystem cdc-pathogen-method"
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenName -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.code.coding.display" "亦可填入 code.text"
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenResultId -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.interpretation.coding.code" "system = TWIDIR CodeSystem twcdc-testresult-values"
* SamplePathogenResults.PathogenResultName -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.interpretation.coding.display" "直接對應"
* SamplePathogenResults.MasterId -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.valueCodeableConcept.coding.code" "system = CodeSystem cdc-pathogen；僅有大類(無 DetailId)時填大類代碼，有細類時大類為細類之 parent，可省略"
* SamplePathogenResults.MasterName -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.valueCodeableConcept.coding.display" "與 MasterId 同一 coding"
* SamplePathogenResults.DetailId -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.valueCodeableConcept.coding.code" "system = CodeSystem cdc-pathogen；優先使用細類代碼"
* SamplePathogenResults.DetailName -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.valueCodeableConcept.coding.display" "與 DetailId 同一 coding"
* SamplePathogenResults.SubTypeId -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.component[subtype].valueCodeableConcept.coding.code" "component.code = CDCNIDRSObservation#PATHOGEN_SUBTYPE；附錄四未提供次分型代碼系統，coding.system 由疾管署定義"
* SamplePathogenResults.SubTypeName -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.component[subtype].valueCodeableConcept.text" "同時可填入 coding.display"
* SamplePathogenResults.Comments -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.note.text" "直接對應"
* SamplePathogenResults.ResultDay -> "Observation-nidrs-pathogen-result: Observation.effectiveDateTime" "C# DateTime 序列化值(如 2025-01-02T10:20:30，無時區)轉為 FHIR 時補上 +08:00"
